# Render from the repository root with: python demo/render.py demo/pretty.tape
Output demo/pretty.gif
Source demo/setup.tape

Hide
Type "cd ../realworld/axum && clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show

Type "byteseek -p -e DefaultBodyLimit -e PAYLOAD_TOO_LARGE src"
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Screenshot docs/pretty.png
Sleep 500ms
